            <li><span class="mk n">3</span><span><b>Data flows down only.</b> A child cannot change its parent's widget, so a parent never needs a rebuild because of a child.</span></li>
            <li><span class="mk n">4</span><span><b>updateChild stops at identical widgets.</b> const and cached widgets cut whole branches, even inside the subtree.</span></li>
          </ul>
